{"name_en": "Sabostius", "zh": "薩博斯", "sei": "薩", "mei": "博斯", "zh_full": "薩博斯提烏斯", "sex": "m", "years": [361, 361], "birth": null, "death": 361, "death_violent": true, "polity": "羅馬帝國", "role": "其他", "place": "阿奎萊亞", "lat": 45.77, "lon": 13.37, "offices": ["市議員"], "kin": [], "friends": ["Nigrinus (rebel)"], "foes": ["Julian (emperor)"], "bio": "阿奎萊亞城的元老。尼格里努斯據城叛變時，他與羅慕路斯一同挑撥不和，不顧後果。城降後被判有罪，處斬。", "stats": [20, 20, 40, 45, 35], "lean": "無", "conf": "C", "src": "Ammianus 21.12"}
